<p>Special Chicken Dish</p>
<p class="price">₹199</p>
</div>
<div class="food">
<h3>🍜 Chowmein</h3>
<p>Hot And Tasty Chowmein</p>
<p class="price">₹79</p>
</div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
<h2>Contact Us</h2>
<p>Phone: 726737737</p>
</section>

<footer>
<p>© 2026 Rajbhar Restaurant</p>
<p>Thank You For Visiting ❤️</p>
</footer>
